477629269728542", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "54.png", "id": "2168329600294801", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821920_2168329606961467_363164685472695592_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vcBprDy8oTcQ7kNvwF-Jupk&_nc_oc=AdqbuNdS8joOhjRlVUi2H0ny6PGpzKk8ocM4s5fqahGWoZDBEivWaQUIZIss6DvrmIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVrjhETf2HW22ZlB47Mjb_oNR-uQ1Aa-qagstzN1PfzA&oe=6B09BC6A"}, {"file_name": "56.png", "id": "3192831004188895", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3192831010855561_4936191764635040575_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gDn1ZdJPry0Q7kNvwGnEklS&_nc_oc=AdplqcLijAFAe6VcbJVtUg2yGFnNb5-e1sZrEazKhk6oYA-tonrwmqHuALmPoxmeEKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ32c28T9jkwORpgcNILq7jKZhq1JQQfwo5Ode2rtPImA&oe=6B09A205"}, {"file_name": "55.png", "id": "653949614301641", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818938_653949617634974_6147528582118108916_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qZxGbNH9oKQQ7kNvwF9lyp5&_nc_oc=AdqPA68FYSh1dNOCgAzivLvcR9PlAj4gZAbUloHsnmtsnEIq7wu0O9dyz33Irh3MHlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRLHyvFrp3oCqxhcbJrRsxVR8bN_oQkmF38Y9ppC85vjg&oe=6B09B544"}, {"file_name": "57.png", "id": "1185328162910619", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819980_1185328166243952_1407589883910908821_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-i5MPxv6dz4Q7kNvwHTS3GB&_nc_oc=AdrViHFErm3A1S_kdy5A_AU7p2u87w7al2KceQYDXP9LK9scFS61e67Q-bxL45qfPkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-I-9ObgY1nNR6sG9T-bytOESvx-LXLNS0q8bj5zbZJA&oe=6B09A228"}, {"file_name": "58.png", "id": "2127176631064606", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830590_2127176634397939_3343901205445722944_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J0uLfvuXGHsQ7kNvwFPWIoG&_nc_oc=AdpZvr1WfBaLrLbc8tx5k8aLlPXDyPOnK--x5NfQTAr-6LJFqQZZnnrMWxNSthcszik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSe4HSejqx9MI-4lHMPyX43HUnq0Nq9Q6or-bJ0B7Pe1A&oe=6B09AB40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Elite M2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Liderazgo, comunicaci\u00f3n y estrategia... todo comienza antes de la presentaci\u00f3n.\n\nEn esta app, no solo deber\u00e1s preparar una exposici\u00f3n impecable para el comit\u00e9 de tu empresa: tambi\u00e9n tendr\u00e1s que enfrentar el verdadero reto previo\u2026 tu equipo.\n\nAsume el rol de l\u00edder o miembro clave de un grupo de trabajo que debe presentar un proyecto ante la alta direcci\u00f3n. El problema: el equipo est\u00e1 fracturado. Malentendidos, diferencias de visi\u00f3n, egos heridos y tensiones acumuladas amenazan con arruinar la presentaci\u00f3n antes de que siquiera empiece.\n\nTu misi\u00f3n ser\u00e1 reconstruir la confianza, facilitar conversaciones dif\u00edciles, tomar decisiones dif\u00edciles y asegurarte de que todos trabajen juntos con un objetivo com\u00fan. La din\u00e1mica se desarrolla a trav\u00e9s de conversaciones interactivas, decisiones morales y estrat\u00e9gicas, y escenarios realistas basados en experiencias laborales reales.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas principales:\n\n- Di\u00e1logos ramificados y decisiones con impacto.\n\n- Perfiles \u00fanicos de personajes con motivaciones y conflictos diversos.\n\n- M\u00faltiples desenlaces posibles seg\u00fan tus elecciones.\n\n- Ideal para desarrollo de habilidades blandas: liderazgo, negociaci\u00f3n, empat\u00eda y gesti\u00f3n de crisis.\n\n- Perfecto para formaciones corporativas o jugadores interesados en din\u00e1micas sociales.\n\nPrep\u00e1rate, lidera, negocia\u2026 y conquista la sala de juntas.", "short_description": "Tienes que realizar una presentaci\u00f3n muy importante ante el comit\u00e9 directivo pero antes deber\u00e1s colaborar con tu equipo para resolver tensiones internas, malentendidos y conflictos interpersonales. Cada decisi\u00f3n cuenta: tus habilidades de comunicaci\u00f3n, liderazgo y empat\u00eda determinar\u00e1n el \u00e9xito de la reuni\u00f3n final."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lableni.webs.upv.es/privacy-policy-elite/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LabLENI", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lableni.webs.upv.es/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7183063251706786"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "605930395840129"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "605930395840129"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1746775200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "605930395840129"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29192340493685746", "version": "1.22"}, "id": "1063745411451899", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7183063248373453", "i